WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:02.640
- So perhaps my favorite
story over the weekend

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:04.860
was that John Roberts, Chief
Justice of the Supreme Court,

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:06.980
was screaming at the other Justices

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:08.670
saying that they have to dismiss

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:10.470
the Texas versus Pennsylvania case

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:12.240
that I covered last week.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:15.310
This story was obvious nonsense
for many different reasons.

00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:17.110
The first, as I covered in the video,

00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:19.580
is that the case was absolute nonsense.

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:21.200
It didn't fit the court's jurisdiction.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:24.470
The court effectively voted
nine to zero to get rid of it.

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:26.650
No one was going to grant cert on this.

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:29.200
The second is that the Supreme
Court simply doesn't leak.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:30.780
You never hear from the insides,

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:33.280
mainly because the court clerks
care about their reputation

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:35.240
and wanna work for really fancy law firms.

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:36.910
So they're not going to leak.

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:38.930
And the third is that they
couldn't scream in person

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:40.500
because they didn't meet in person.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.090
The Supreme Court hasn't
been meeting in person

00:00:42.090 --> 00:00:44.610
or even holding oral
arguments in person for months

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:45.560
because of COVID.

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:46.850
But if you want some Christmas cheer,

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:48.940
check out this video I
did on all the laws broken

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:50.650
in National Lampoon's Christmas Vacation,

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.183
and I'll see you in court.

